  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Summon forth the strength born of the desperation to succeed. When a linked ally makes a successful attack against an enemy, you can spend your reaction and expend six link depth from their link to force them to reroll that attack without advantage or disadvantage. On a successful hit, the original attack is instead a critical hit and deals an additional 40 psychic damage.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
